[
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-1",
    "text": "He loved people fully without depending on them for His sense of self.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": true,
    "tags": [
      "Unreciprocated effort",
      "Rejection"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-2",
    "text": "He named their failure honestly, didn't pretend it was fine, and still didn't make it mean they didn't love Him.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": true,
    "tags": [
      "Being forgotten or dropped",
      "Forgiving without pretending it's fine"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-3",
    "text": "Love and release existed together.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": true,
    "tags": [
      "Letting someone walk away",
      "Grief over someone's choices"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-4",
    "text": "Accepting others' free will includes accepting that their choices affect how close they can be to you.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Letting someone walk away",
      "Redefining a relationship / chosen family"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-5",
    "text": "When something stings, separate what happened from the story I'm telling about it. Then ask what the action might say about their capacity, fears, or patterns rather than my worth.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": true,
    "tags": [
      "Rejection",
      "Words and actions not matching"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-6",
    "text": "Grief demands a witness.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Feeling alone or unsupported",
      "Grief over someone's choices"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-7",
    "text": "I'm building my friendships from a place of want, not need.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Redefining a relationship / chosen family",
      "Unreciprocated effort"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-8",
    "text": "Their reaction is theirs. I was honest and kind.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": true,
    "tags": [
      "Setting a boundary"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-9",
    "text": "Honest and kind is enough. I don't owe anyone a case file.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Setting a boundary",
      "Conflict & hard conversations"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-10",
    "text": "Clarity is kindness. Vagueness to keep the peace isn't peace.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Conflict & hard conversations"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-11",
    "text": "I can name what's happening without deciding who someone is.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Naming poor behavior"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-12",
    "text": "Their silence is information, not a verdict on me.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Being forgotten or dropped",
      "Rejection"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-13",
    "text": "Jesus got angry and didn't sin. Anger isn't the problem. What I do with it is.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Handling emotions"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-14",
    "text": "Sighing deeply and walking away was something Jesus did.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Handling emotions",
      "Pressure to perform or prove myself"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-15",
    "text": "I'm allowed to leave a table where I'm not being received.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Rejection",
      "Letting someone walk away"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-16",
    "text": "A no doesn't need a reason to be valid.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Setting a boundary"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-17",
    "text": "Compassion that empties me isn't sustainable. Even Jesus went up the mountain alone.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Compassion fatigue",
      "Needing rest"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-18",
    "text": "Not everyone who says the right words is safe. Watch the fruit.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Naming poor behavior",
      "Words and actions not matching"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-19",
    "text": "Love does not require me to stay available for harm.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Setting a boundary",
      "Betrayal"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-20",
    "text": "Repair goes through the hurt, not around it.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Forgiving without pretending it's fine"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-21",
    "text": "I can be sad about someone's choices and still let them make them.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Grief over someone's choices",
      "Letting someone walk away"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-22",
    "text": "Being misunderstood by the people who knew me longest doesn't make them right.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Rejection",
      "Redefining a relationship / chosen family"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-23",
    "text": "Someone's disappointment in my no is not an emergency.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Setting a boundary"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-24",
    "text": "I will not shrink the truth to keep a crowd.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Letting someone walk away",
      "Conflict & hard conversations"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-25",
    "text": "Grief and hope can share a room.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Handling emotions",
      "Grief over someone's choices"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-26",
    "text": "When words and actions don't match, I believe the actions, and I stay kind.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Words and actions not matching"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-27",
    "text": "What someone can give me says something about their capacity, not my worth.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Unreciprocated effort",
      "Rejection"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-28",
    "text": "I can hold my ground without raising my voice.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Conflict & hard conversations",
      "Setting a boundary"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-29",
    "text": "Rest is obedience, not laziness.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Needing rest"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-30",
    "text": "I don't have to answer questions asked in bad faith.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Setting a boundary",
      "Naming poor behavior"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-31",
    "text": "Being chosen freely is worth more than being kept by chasing.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Letting someone walk away",
      "Rejection"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-32",
    "text": "The right people won't need me to over-explain.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Setting a boundary",
      "Redefining a relationship / chosen family"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-33",
    "text": "Jesus wept before He acted. Feeling comes first, and it isn't weakness.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Handling emotions"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-34",
    "text": "I can love someone from a distance that keeps me whole.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Letting someone walk away",
      "Setting a boundary"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-35",
    "text": "It isn't my job to make everyone comfortable with my boundaries.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Setting a boundary"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-36",
    "text": "Guarding my heart isn't closing it.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Setting a boundary",
      "Betrayal"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-37",
    "text": "Today has enough. Tomorrow's what-ifs can wait their turn.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Anxiety & Uncertainty"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-38",
    "text": "God was not surprised by their choice, and He isn't done with me.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Grief over someone's choices",
      "Betrayal"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-39",
    "text": "I release outcomes, not people.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Letting someone walk away",
      "Grief over someone's choices"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-40",
    "text": "I am not the only worker. When the need is bigger than me, I ask for more hands.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Compassion fatigue",
      "Feeling alone or unsupported"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-41",
    "text": "Noticing what giving costs me is wisdom, not selfishness.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Compassion fatigue"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-42",
    "text": "Their urgency doesn't have to become my emergency.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Setting a boundary",
      "Compassion fatigue"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-43",
    "text": "I can say the hard thing at someone's own table, calmly and specifically.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Conflict & hard conversations",
      "Naming poor behavior"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-44",
    "text": "Naming a pattern isn't the same as labeling a person. Watch for repetition.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Naming poor behavior"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-45",
    "text": "A kindness that doesn't match what's underneath it is worth noticing out loud.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Naming poor behavior",
      "Betrayal"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-46",
    "text": "\"What did I do wrong?\" is a fair question to ask when I'm mistreated.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Naming poor behavior",
      "Conflict & hard conversations"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-47",
    "text": "Some pearls are mine to keep. Access is earned.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Setting a boundary"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-48",
    "text": "I don't chase. I stay honest, stay kind, and let people choose.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Letting someone walk away",
      "Unreciprocated effort"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-49",
    "text": "Their reaction to my truth is information about them, not instruction for me.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Setting a boundary",
      "Conflict & hard conversations"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-50",
    "text": "Loving people and trusting people are two different decisions.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Unreciprocated effort",
      "Betrayal"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-51",
    "text": "Peace that only lasts while I keep everyone happy isn't peace. It's management.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Pressure to perform or prove myself",
      "Needing rest"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-52",
    "text": "I can be the one who says it plainly and the one who says it gently. Both at once.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Conflict & hard conversations"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-53",
    "text": "Feeling it fully is not the same as being ruled by it.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Handling emotions"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-54",
    "text": "Joy is allowed to land all the way.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Handling emotions"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-55",
    "text": "Someone else's hardness of heart is grief for me to feel, not a wall for me to break down.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Grief over someone's choices",
      "Handling emotions"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-56",
    "text": "I can end the giving while people are still there wanting more.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Compassion fatigue",
      "Setting a boundary"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-57",
    "text": "Not responding right away is not the same as not caring.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Setting a boundary",
      "Needing rest"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-58",
    "text": "The dust of rejection isn't mine to keep. I can shake it off.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Rejection",
      "Letting someone walk away"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-59",
    "text": "Excitement is information about me, not evidence about them.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Going slow & self-protection"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-60",
    "text": "I let people show me who they are. Slowly. In small things.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Going slow & self-protection"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-61",
    "text": "The right people are fine with slow. Watch who pushes.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Going slow & self-protection"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-62",
    "text": "Someone who rushes closeness is telling me something about them.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Going slow & self-protection"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-63",
    "text": "I don't have to decide they're amazing. I get to find out.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Going slow & self-protection"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-64",
    "text": "Being wanted for what I can provide is not the same as being loved.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Going slow & self-protection"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-65",
    "text": "Trust is earned in the mundane, not declared in the intense.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Going slow & self-protection"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-66",
    "text": "How they treat people who can't do anything for them is who they are.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Going slow & self-protection"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-67",
    "text": "A no is the best test I have. Their reaction is the answer.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Going slow & self-protection"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-68",
    "text": "I can be warm and still hold the pearls back.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Going slow & self-protection"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-69",
    "text": "New people start in the outer circle. That's not cold. That's wise.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Going slow & self-protection"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-70",
    "text": "Fast attachment was how I survived. Slow attachment is how I live.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Going slow & self-protection"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-71",
    "text": "If I stopped giving, who would still be here? That's my circle.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Going slow & self-protection"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-72",
    "text": "Jesus loved the crowd and still didn't entrust Himself to it.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Going slow & self-protection"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-73",
    "text": "Most of what people do is about their day, not my worth.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Taking things personally"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-74",
    "text": "I can feel the sting without believing the story.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Taking things personally"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-75",
    "text": "Their silence has a hundred possible reasons. My unworthiness is the least likely one.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Taking things personally"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-76",
    "text": "If my best friend told me this happened to her, I would not say it was her fault.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Taking things personally"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-77",
    "text": "I don't know their intent. I only know my guess. Those are different.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Taking things personally"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-78",
    "text": "Taking it personally is my brain trying to make it fixable. It isn't mine to fix.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Taking things personally"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-79",
    "text": "I'm allowed to ask what they meant instead of deciding what they meant.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Taking things personally"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-80",
    "text": "Their capacity ran out. My value didn't.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Taking things personally"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-81",
    "text": "A snub says where they are. It doesn't say who I am.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Taking things personally"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-82",
    "text": "I can let a moment be about them and still be kind.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Taking things personally"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-83",
    "text": "The ten percent that's mine, I'll own. The rest, I set down.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Taking things personally"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "seed-truth-84",
    "text": "Jesus walked through the crowd. I can walk through this.",
    "source": "Re-Centered",
    "starred": false,
    "tags": [
      "Taking things personally"
    ]
  }
]